CM Vee Beam
CM
CM Find optimal angle for a 1.5 wavelength Vee beam
CM
CE
SY height=12
SY d=1in
GW 1,3,0,-d,height,0,d,height,awg14
! 0.75 wavelength nominal
SY y=15.97
SY dy=y*sin(theta)
SY dx=y*cos(theta)
GW 2,13,0,-d,height,dx,-dy,height,awg14
GW 3,13,0,d,height,dx,dy,height,awg14
GE 0
EX 0,1,2,0,1,0
GN -1
FR 0,1,0,0,14,0
RP 0,37,73,1000,0,0,5,5
EN
